      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580325493603471361",
      "text": "RT @flightradar24 #A320 #4U9525 initially climbed to 38k ft before starting to descend and lost signal at 6.8k ft http://t.co/LUWkDrBR9a",
