      "parent_id": 5.810636187305533e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580476624069619712",
      "text": "@marcepa49 @flightradar24 @isobelroe It turns out there was no distress call made. I'm almost certain this was a hi-jacking now.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 21:09:46 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803265274952376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580329566419456000",
      "text": "@Minus777 @london_thfc @marcepa49 @flightradar24 @isobelroe if a decomp why would they not be diverting away from mountains to nearest apt?",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:25:25 +0000 2015",
