    },
    {
      "post_id": "580478159126175745",
      "text": "@marcepa49 @flightradar24 @isobelroe If someone set the autopilot to fly it into the ground, the descent rate would have been constant.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 21:15:52 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.804778328261304e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580329211744763904",
      "text": "@london_thfc @marcepa49 @flightradar24 @isobelroe It looks like a decompression. If not, someone crashed it deliberately.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Mar 24 11:24:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.803287510258237e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "580329059399401472",
      "text": "@london_thfc @Minus777 @flightradar24 @isobelroe although steep descent !",
