      "parent_id": 5.804781591261757e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581174677554380800",
      "text": "@marcepa49 The autopilot wasn't set to 100 feet. It was flown manually. FlightRadar24 has made that up.",
